  "title": "汐斯塔狂想曲",
  "storyCode": "OF-8",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "061436c054697d91c9b11bbe85e5659a9a287f8d5dd53e798cfcf843abca9d11",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "喝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "哼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "它真的有在变虚弱吗？这模样完全看不出来啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "小心岩浆！这家伙肚子里到底吞下了多少黑曜石！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨大源石虫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "————————————————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "虽然有些可怜，但我们也不能手下留情！天火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "好啦，我明白！现在可不是保留实力的时候了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "那么，这招如何！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨大源石虫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "————————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "熔岩虫被激怒了......！我去挡住它们，攻击就交给你们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "大尾巴！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "总算能从岩浆的缝隙里瞄准弱点了呐，但是对方这个尺寸，我可不保证能有效喔！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨大源石虫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——————！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#3",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "成功了！它被赶回之前的方向了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "太好了！这样一来，市民们就都彻底安全了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "真是的！没想到解决一只虫子会这么费劲！这下我的裙子也毁了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "毕竟它带领着一整支族群。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "如果不是有人先破坏了它们的生存环境，也许......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "我累了！不要再提起这种让人疲惫的话题！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "哈哈，我也已经，累得快站不起来了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "但是，我们得回到汐斯塔，还有人在等我们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#7",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "倒是能理解你的想法啦，不过站不稳的时候找同伴搭把手，也是成熟的女性应该学会的事情喔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#7",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "谢、谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "好了，凯旋而归总是令人心情愉悦。赶紧回去吧，说不定还能剩下点度假时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "......但是......这里还是迟早会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "大尾巴？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "啊，我这就来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "......天火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "但我们应该尊重这座城市的选择，剩下的不该由我们插手，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
